                                                "sense_id": "142afcdb-f8eb-3721-87cf-faec62de35e6",
                                                "text": "The criterion for positivity was determined for each antigen of each species applying a mixture model to the PP data which assumed two inherent Gaussian distributions: a narrow distribution or seronegatives, and a broader distribution of seropositives."
